{% extends "base.mjml" %}
{% block content %}
<mj-section mj-class="body-section">
  <mj-column>
    <mj-text>Hi everyone,</mj-text>
    <mj-text>
      Thank you for being part of PyConZA 2026! Whether you came to
      Beginners' Day, the talks, the sprints, or all of it, you helped make
      this year's conference what it was. PyConZA is volunteer-run and
      not-for-profit, so it only works because of the people who show up, and
      we're grateful you did.
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>

<mj-section mj-class="body-section">
  <mj-column>
    <mj-text mj-class="heading-2">Tell us how we did</mj-text>
    <mj-text>
      We'd love to hear what worked, what didn't, and what you'd like to see
      next year. The feedback form takes just a few minutes, and it shapes how
      we plan future conferences.
    </mj-text>
    <mj-button
      mj-class="action-button"
      href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdXSEf3ryd4XremZWC5vvbda9SXn19wK-a09b4gD42b1glbAQ/viewform?usp=header"
      >Share your feedback</mj-button
    >
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>

<mj-section mj-class="body-section">
  <mj-column>
    <mj-text mj-class="heading-2">Thank you to our sponsors</mj-text>
    <mj-text>
      A huge thank you to our sponsors, whose support makes PyConZA possible.
      Because of them we can keep tickets affordable, run a free Beginners'
      Day, and bring the South African Python community together each year.
      Please take a moment to check out what they do. We couldn't do it
      without them.
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>

<mj-section mj-class="body-section">
  <mj-column>
    <mj-text mj-class="heading-2">See you in Cape Town in 2027</mj-text>
    <mj-text>
      We're excited to announce that PyConZA 2027 will take place in Cape Town
      in October. Venue and dates are still to be confirmed, and we'll share
      them as soon as they're locked in.
    </mj-text>
    <mj-text>Thanks again for a wonderful week. We hope to see you next year!</mj-text>
    <mj-text>
      Warm regards,
      <br />
      The PyConZA 2026 Team
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>
{% endblock content %}
